 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Prima che» with obligatory subjunctive",
     "texto": [
      "It always takes the subjunctive because the subordinate action has not yet happened at the reference point: «Partiamo **prima che faccia** buio» (let's leave before it gets dark); «Uscì **prima che arrivasse** il temporale» (he left before the storm arrived)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«A meno che non» with exceptive conditional value",
     "texto": [
      "It expresses a single exception that would cancel the main action, governed by the congiuntivo and with the traditional expletive «non»: «Andremo al mare, **a meno che non piova** a dirotto» (we will go to the seaside, unless it pours down)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Finché» with indicative for duration",
     "texto": [
      "«**Finché c'è** vita, c'è speranza» (while there is life, there is hope); «Restammo in biblioteca **finché non chiuse** i battenti» (we stayed in the library until it closed its doors)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
